<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Privacy behavior of the Claude Certification Study Kit." eyebrow="Privacy">
  <article class="prose"><h1>Your study history stays on your device.</h1><p>The application has no accounts, analytics, advertising, server-side database, or progress API. Quiz answers and session state are stored in your browser's local storage.</p><h2>Your controls</h2><p>You can export progress as JSON, import it into another browser, or clear site data using your browser settings. Removing browser storage removes the local history.</p><h2>External resources</h2><p>Following a source link takes you to another site governed by its own privacy terms. The application itself does not send your study activity to a third party.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>
